## Input

```mlk
// What an import tree rejects: a name the group is brought in under, which renames nothing,
// and the keyword `self` written where a name of a path belongs. What follows the two
// mistakes is a module of the language all the same.

module project::app

use std::{core} as core

use std::core::self

fun main(): Int =
    1

```

