## Diagnostics

272..274: Expected the end of the import but instead found 'as': what is brought in under a name is one name, and the names a group takes are renamed where each is written, as in `use a::{b as c}`.
296..300: Expected a name but instead found 'self': what `self` names is the path the group it is written in takes names from, and it is written inside the group, as in `use std::prelude::{self}`.
